OL,3,GNEWSARange Rover mounts Tesla in high
OL,4,Astreet crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Range Rover mounted a Tesla following
OL,7,Fa crash on a West Sussex high street,
OL,8,Fpolice have said.
OL,10,FOfficers were called to reports of the
OL,11,Fcollision in Steyning High Street
OL,12,Fshortly after 16:00 GMT on Saturday.
OL,14,FSussex Police said no injuries were
OL,15,Freported.
OL,17,FThe force added that no arrests had
OL,18,Fbeen made.
